ity of large-scale mutagenesis data, and our conclusions can help guide future mutagenesis studies.","topics":[],"score":193798,"global_rank":335410},{"name":"cmfeng/ext-domain-model","owner":"cmfeng","html_url":"https://github.com/cmfeng/ext-domain-model","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":null,"topics":[],"score":193797,"global_rank":335417},{"name":"cmfeng/domain-model","owner":"cmfeng","html_url":"https://github.com/cmfeng/domain-model","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":null,"topics":[],"score":193797,"global_rank":335418},{"name":"ahrav/nothing-to-see-here","owner":"ahrav","html_url":"https://github.com/ahrav/nothing-to-see-here","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":193797,"global_rank":335420},{"name":"RohanGupta24/Sample-Graphics","owner":"RohanGupta24","html_url":"https://github.com/RohanGupta24/Sample-Graphics","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Processing","description":"During Hello World, I learned how to implement a simple graphics program.","topics":[],"score":193797,"global_rank":335430},{"name":"RohanGupta24/Hello-World","owner":"RohanGupta24","html_url":"https://github.com/RohanGupta24/Hello-World","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":"The following are some of the projects that I worked on during Hello World, a freshman-only hackathon at Purdue University.","topics":[],"score":193797,"global_rank":335432},{"name":"loganzartman/Learning-SDL2","owner":"loganzartman","html_url":"https://github.com/loganzartman/Learning-SDL2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"Watch me try to learn C and SDL2 at the same time! ","topics":[],"score":193797,"global_rank":335438},{"name":"andreaseguya/andreaseguya","owner":"andreaseguya","html_url":"https://github.com/andreaseguya/andreaseguya","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"is